# Binary assets must not go through line-ending conversion. Git sniffed the
# placeholder PDF as text and warned it would rewrite LF to CRLF on checkout,
# which corrupts the byte offsets in a PDF's xref table.
*.pdf   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.JPG   binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
